2026-07-27T12:05:59.0064312Z i /tmp/RtmpWdyKCZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0065003Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0065467Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0065864Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0066491Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0067421Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:05:59.0068468Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
